"Wa Shi is truly a dragon, titled Prince of the Heavens; his fish form avoids alarming cities."
"At heart Wa Shi feels himself a timid carp hiding in a dragon's guise."
"Wa Shi fights with Math Formations, striking by calculated position so his hits can't be dodged."
"Wa Shi seeds foes with water orbs, then detonates them and threads them with lightning."
"On the journey Wa Shi flies ahead as herald, announcing Jin's arrival at sects and cities."
